An exercise-example includes an aerobic-exercise-example and includes an aquatic-exercise-example and includes a resistance-exercise-example.
Every exercise-therapy is a prominent-physical-therapy-modality.
A mind-body-practice-example includes a yoga-example and includes a tai-chi-example and includes a qigong-example.
